OL,3,GNEWSAHas a takeaway 4,000 miles from
OL,4,ACuba become a victim of Trump's
OL,5,Asanctions?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe owner of a takeaway who claimed
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump's sanctions on
OL,9,FCuba led to #7,000 in payments being
OL,10,Fwithheld said the issue has been
OL,11,Fresolved.
OL,13,FCarlos Arguelles Leblanch, who owns the
OL,14,FCuban Sandwich Factory, said he
OL,15,Fbelieved banking software mistakenly
OL,16,Fidentified his business as one which
OL,17,Fshould be subject to recently
OL,18,Fstepped-up US sanctions.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1788432974
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHas a takeaway 4,000 miles from
OL,4,ACuba become a victim of Trump's
OL,5,Asanctions?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany of his customers come through the
OL,8,Fdelivery app Deliveroo. In his case,
OL,9,Fwhen an order is placed, payment first
OL,10,Fgoes through Citibank before reaching
OL,11,Fhim, and this, he claimed, is where the
OL,12,Fissues occurred.
OL,14,FCitibank said: "The matter required a
OL,15,Fnecessary compliance review, which has
OL,16,Fnow been completed, and the payments
OL,17,Fhave been released."
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
